    "- ✅ Defined the target/proxy.\n",
    "- ✅ Selected an evaluation metric.\n",
    "- ✅ Showed the unit of analysis.\n",
    "- ✅ Explained why ML is appropriate.\n",
    "- ✅ Connected predictions to a real business action."
   ]
  }
